# Spin Cycle (levels/solo/spin.txt), the waltz route: the spring step and the belt's long jump,
# the rinse's trampoline posts, drum 1's zigzag (hop its floor spikes against the belt, spring
# up, ride the shelf back, spring up, out along the roof), three even hops over the table's
# baskets and Down, then the dryer: caught at its wall till ONE, up onto its roof, its pit
# trampolines on ONE (a toot at each apex for the nuggets up high), the merge, and drum 2 the
# long way round for the high exit (caught on its floor trampoline till ONE), then the last
# turn: the posts, the fast belt, the trough. Format: src/capture/timeline.rs.
